& [ImplementationPhase]
  + begins only after formation verification publication fetched equality and immediate bookend
  + authorizes only pure local compiler verifier package and host-free tests; no remote effect

& [LivePhase]
  + begins only after exact implementation gates publication fetched equality and immediate bookend
  + authorizes one bounded new-root installation two compiler and two verifier fresh processes retrieval and conservation audit

& [PhysicalBuildPhase]
  + absent from this contract; source transfer extraction workspace creation toolchain observation dependency resolution Cargo execution Git mutation and build timing require a new signed successor

& [StopRule]
  + a missing bookend mismatch or broadened claim returns to the preceding no-effect phase
